---@field type unkey.DnsRecordType Record type to create. `ALIAS` is not a real DNS record type: it means an apex-compatible alias, which providers expose as ALIAS, ANAME, or a flattened CNAME. Apex domains cannot hold a plain CNAME, so they receive `ALIAS` where a subdomain receives `CNAME`.
